	    <div class="fr-view">


        <h2 class="subhead1">Write-ins</h2><p>Your write-in votes will only count for candidates who have properly filed appropriate forms with the Lake County Clerk&apos;s office.</p><p><a class="Hyperlink" href="https://www.lakecountyil.gov/DocumentCenter/View/971" target="_blank" aria-label="How to Cast a Write-in Vote on an Optical Scan Ballot (PDF) Opens in new window">How to Cast a Write-in Vote on an Optical Scan Ballot (PDF)</a></p>
    </div>

<script type="text/javascript">
